SetAgreements_Budgets_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a call into Budgets is already running
│   └── it should revert with ReentrantCall
├── when the caller is not the deployer
│   └── it should revert with NotDeployer
├── when agreements is already set
│   └── it should revert with AlreadySet
├── when the address is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when the deployer sets it once
    ├── it should store it
    └── it should emit AgreementsSet
